# Logs
*.log
# Anchored: an unanchored `logs/` also matches the SOURCE package
# orchestrator/logs/, so new modules there were silently untracked --
# jobdata_s3.py was written, staged and simply absent from the commit.
# The runtime log directory here is log/ (singular), covered above.
/logs/

